# Bot runtime state — contains real chat/user IDs and must not be committed.
# NOTE: chat_configs.json is already tracked in git history; adding it here
# only stops future commits. To remove the IDs from GitHub, Red must also
# remove the file from git history (e.g. git rm --cached + a history rewrite,
# or delete it from the repo on GitHub).
